         MACRO
&LABEL   IOSCKVOL   &SAVE
         AIF     ('&LABEL' EQ '').S1
&LABEL   DS    0H
.S1      ANOP
****************************************************************
*                                                              *
*        THE IOSCKVOL EXPANSION CALLS A SUBROUTINE WHICH       *
*        DETERMINES IF VOLUME VERIFICATION IS NEEDED.  THE     *
*        SUBROUTINE WILL RETURN CONTROL IF NONE IS NEEDED.     *
*        IF VOLUME VERIFICATION IS NEEDED, THE SUBROUTINE      *
*        DOES NOT RETURN; THE NEXT TIME THE SIO EXIT IS        *
*        ENTERED FOR THIS REQUEST VOLUME VERIFICATION WILL     *
*        WILL HAVE BEEN COMPLETED.                             *
*                                                              *
****************************************************************
.*                                                             *
.*       NOTES: 1. IOSCKVOL SHOULD BE USED ONLY IN SIO EXITS   *
.*                 FOR MOUNTABLE DEVICES WHEN IT HAS BEEN      *
.*                 DETERMINED THAT UNSOLICITED DEVICE END HAS  *
.*                 OCCURRED (UCBUDE IS ON).                    *
.*              2. IOSSIO MUST BE INCLUDED IN THE ASSEMBLY TO  *
.*                 PROVIDE EQUATES; A DSECT OF IOCOM IS ALSO   *
.*                 REQUIRED.                                   *
.*              3. THE OPERAND FOR IOSCKVOL CAN BE OMITTED OR  *
.*                 'SAVE' CAN BE SPECIFIED. THE MACRO EXPAN-   *
.*                 SION USES REGISTERS 14 AND 15 TO CALL THE   *
.*                 SUBROUTINE; IF 'SAVE' IS CODED THE REGIS-   *
.*                 TERS WILL BE SAVED AND RESTORED.  WHEN NO   *
.*                 OPERAND  IS SPECIFIED, REGISTERS 14 AND 15  *
.*                 ARE NOT SAVED.                              *
.*                                                             *
.***************************************************************
         AIF   ('&SAVE' EQ 'SAVE').S2    REGS14 AND 15 SHOULD BE SAVED
         L     15,IOCVV-IOCOM(,IOCOMR) * GO TO VOLUME VERIFICATION
         BALR  14,15                   * RTN POSSIBLY W/O RETURN
         MEXIT
.S2      ST    14,64(,SAVER)       * SAVE REGISTERS (AFTER
         ST    15,68(,SAVER)       * 16 WORD SAVE AREA)
         L     15,IOCVV-IOCOM(,IOCOMR) * GO TO VOLUME VERIFICATION
         BALR  14,15                   * RTN POSSIBLY W/O RETURN
         L     14,64(,SAVER)       * RESTORE
         L     15,68(,SAVER)       * REGISTERS
         MEND
